5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m a bit worried about the person who has to count all the money. It seems like a lot of work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Minato, the workload is secondary. We need accurate revenue projections first. Guessing fees again is unacceptable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Ryuji. We need hard data, not guesses. Minato, your concern is valid, but accuracy comes first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"You’re all so serious. Let’s just make it fun, not a chore. Who wants to look at the sign-in sheets?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"May, “fun” doesn’t balance the books. I’m taking the sign-in sheets and the rota. Let’s see who actually shows up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think the ledger might show how long counting takes. I’ll look at that and the treasurer’s hours.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I’ll examine the bank statements and last year’s ledger. We must verify actual inflows against recorded expenses to establish a reliable baseline.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’ll check the sign-up records for mid-year joiners and the taster evening forms. We need to understand who is actually joining and why they stay.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I’ll check the weekday turnout and the winter social. I need to see why people hesitate to commit.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I already claimed the sign-in sheets and the rota. I’m done for this turn.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the hours aren’t too scary. I’ll wait for my results.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the bank statements and ledger. We need to confirm actual cash flow before setting any figures.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll review the mid-year joiners and taster forms. Understanding their journey is key to keeping the door open for newcomers.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I’m curious what the turnout data reveals about that hesitation. Let’s see if the numbers match my gut feeling.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I’m not waiting around for your gut feelings, May. The data will speak for itself. I’ll be reviewing the sign-in sheets and the rota.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’m a little nervous about the numbers. I hope the hours aren’t too many. I’ll wait to hear what everyone finds out.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"I’ll wait for the findings. We need verified figures, not speculation. Let’s proceed to the next round.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minako,,I’ll wait for the findings. Understanding the newcomer journey is essential to keeping the door open. Let’s proceed to the next round.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I’ll wait for the data too. Let’s see if the numbers back up my hunch about the mood.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Fine. I’ll review the sign-in sheets and the rota. Let’s see who’s actually doing the work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
